---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base>
  <section class="shell hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Modern music creation</div>
      <h1>Create music.<br /><span>Build your sound.</span></h1>
      <p>Start with a rough idea and leave with a song-ready plan: sound direction, structure, lyrics brief, production choices and a clean prompt for the tool you use next.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="pill primary" href="/tools/song-studio">Open Rythero Studio</a>
        <a class="pill" href="/learn">Learn from zero</a>
      </div>
      <div class="proof"><span>No sign-up</span><span>Beginner-friendly</span><span>Built for creators</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-card" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="glow"></div>
      <img src="/rythero-mark.svg" alt="" />
      <div class="mini-label">RYTHERO / STUDIO</div>
      <div class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell" id="tools">
    <div class="eyebrow">Tools</div>
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Move the song forward.</h2><p class="muted">Use one workspace when you want the full plan, or a focused tool when you only need one answer.</p></div>
    <div class="grid3">
      <a class="card featured" href="/tools/signature-lab"><div class="tag">NEW · AI + LOCAL</div><h3>Signature Lab</h3><p class="muted">Combine local technical measurements with AI music analysis to understand style, instruments, vocals and production, build a reviewable prompt, merge 2–3 references and compare the result.</p><span class="arrow">Understand and build your sound →</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="/tools/song-studio"><div class="tag">LIVE</div><h3>Rythero Studio</h3><p class="muted">Song Blueprint, Prompt Doctor, Style DNA, Arrangement Map, Lyrics Blueprint, export helpers and local audio analysis.</p><span class="arrow">Open studio →</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="/tools/prompt-builder"><div class="tag">LIVE</div><h3>Prompt Builder</h3><p class="muted">Build a clean music-generation prompt quickly from genre, mood, voice, structure and production choices.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell" id="learn">
    <div class="split">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">AI Music Creator School</div><h2>Start at zero.<br />Leave knowing how to build a song.</h2></div>
      <div class="learn-copy"><p class="muted big">Short, clear and complete lessons. Learn which decisions matter, why they change the song and how to apply them directly with Rythero tools. Every published lesson is gathered in one place and also available in Spanish and Portuguese.</p><a class="learn-link" href="/learn">See all lessons →</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell" id="guides">
    <div class="grid3">
      <div class="card"><h3>From idea to song-ready</h3><p class="muted">Turn a theme into tempo, structure, sound palette, vocal direction and a usable production brief.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Build identity, not imitation</h3><p class="muted">Use Signature Lab and Style DNA to understand transferable musical traits and turn them into an original direction.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Repair before you generate</h3><p class="muted">Prompt Doctor spots vague, overloaded or contradictory instructions before they waste another generation.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero{min-height:76vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;padding:70px 0 90px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,7.2rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:16px 0 26px;max-width:900px}.hero h1 span{color:var(--green)}.hero p{font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.35rem);max-width:760px;color:var(--muted)}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}.proof{display:flex;gap:22px;margin-top:26px;color:#718078;font-size:.84rem}.proof span:before{content:'•';color:var(--green);margin-right:8px}.hero-card{position:relative;min-height:460px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:34px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0c1510,#060906);overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center}.hero-card img{width:min(58%,280px);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(63,255,129,.22));z-index:2}.glow{position:absolute;width:300px;height:300px;background:rgba(48,255,132,.13);filter:blur(70px);border-radius:50%}.mini-label{position:absolute;left:24px;top:22px;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#75847b}.bars{position:absolute;bottom:26px;left:26px;right:26px;height:50px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end}.bars i{display:block;flex:1;background:linear-gradient(var(--green),#0e4929);border-radius:4px 4px 1px 1px}.bars i:nth-child(1){height:22%}.bars i:nth-child(2){height:55%}.bars i:nth-child(3){height:38%}.bars i:nth-child(4){height:86%}.bars i:nth-child(5){height:62%}.bars i:nth-child(6){height:100%}.bars i:nth-child(7){height:46%}.section-head,.split{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;align-items:end;margin:14px 0 26px}.section h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:8px 0}.section-head p{max-width:470px}.featured{position:relative;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(102,255,140,.08)}.featured:hover,.card[href]:hover{border-color:#31583d}.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#041108;background:var(--green);padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:22px;font-weight:900}.tag.dim{background:#151d18;color:#7f8d84}.arrow{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;color:var(--green);font-weight:800}.big{font-size:1.2rem;max-width:600px}.learn-copy{max-width:620px}.learn-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:800}.learn-link:hover{color:#baffc9}@media(max-width:850px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto;padding-top:45px}.hero-card{min-height:330px}.section-head,.split{display:block}.proof{flex-wrap:wrap}.learn-copy{margin-top:20px}}
  </style>
</Base>
